# Configuration of furcate-small-node.service. Copy to
# /etc/furcate/small-node.env (owner root, mode 0644: it holds no secret) and
# edit. The service does not start without the file, and it signs with the
# board's firmware key through the broker; nothing here selects a signer.
#
# --directory  the nodes this one has enrolled and which sensing node each
#              signs for (see directory.example.json). Required.
# --model      the reference model's parameters, one mean vector per label
#              (optional; without one every embedding is escalated unanswered).
# --forward    where escalations go: a file (appended, one JSON object per
#              line), `unix:PATH` for a socket, or `-` for standard output.
# --margin, --audit-every, --min-level, --max-delay-ms, --forward-readings
#              the escalation and acceptance policy; see the docs page.
SMALL_ARGS="--directory /etc/furcate/small-node/directory.json --forward /var/lib/furcate-small-node/escalated.jsonl --margin 0.2 --audit-every 50 --min-level soft --max-delay-ms 5000"
